@startuml phase1-modules
!pragma layout smetana
title Phase 1 (tag final): layered CLI, closed name dispatch
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #46607D
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam componentBorderColor #46607D

component "main.ts\ncomposition root" as main
package "src (single package)" {
  component "cli\nRepl / Lexer / TreeFormatter\n**CommandFactory** (Map of 19 names)" as cli #FCE8E6
  component "application\nEditorSession / History\nEditCommand + 10 concrete commands" as app
  interface "DocumentStore" as port
  component "domain\nSvgDocument / Shape / Group\nRect Circle Ellipse Line Text\n**ShapeFactory** (Map of 6 types)" as domain #FCE8E6
  component "infrastructure\nFileDocumentStore / SvgCodec" as infra
}
main --> cli : assemble
main --> app : assemble
main --> infra : inject adapter
cli --> app : execute
cli --> domain : create / inspect
app --> domain : edit / clone
app --> port
infra ..|> port
infra --> domain : parse / serialize\n(element name -> ShapeFactory)
note bottom of domain
Adding a shape, command, tree label or attribute meaning
means editing ShapeFactory / CommandFactory / TreeFormatter /
Shape.set whitelist: the red modules are closed for extension.
end note
@enduml
